<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective June 6.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     24.77     24.77	  3.91-9.15  3.91-9.15</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     24.77     24.77	  3.72-8.72  3.72-8.72</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     29.59     28.44	 10.44	11.01</p>
<p> White sugar	  29.59     28.44	  5.92	 6.49</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.30	0.28	  0.35	 0.37</p>
</text>
